# Vite production environment (mode: production).
# Loaded automatically by `vite build` / `npm run build` / `npm run build:web`.
#
# Base URL of the production HTTPS origin. The backend context path
# `/chronogram` is REQUIRED (nginx proxies preserving it) because the API
# calls use paths like `/api/auth/login` without the `/chronogram` prefix.
#
# The URL is absolute (not just "/chronogram") so the SAME bundle works both
# for the web app (same-origin, no CORS involved) and for the Android app,
# whose WebView origin is https://localhost and therefore needs a full URL.
#
# This value is baked into the bundle at build time: rebuild after changing it.
# Not a secret (just a URL) -> safe to version.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://devaidalab.unicas.it/chronogram
